  "releaseNotes": "Performance\n\nLess memory per generation (#314, closes #313). The generator worked out every method's setup signature for every target, to keep numbered setups such as Get\\_1() clear of other setup names. Most targets have no numbered setup, so it now does that only when one needs it. Generating 400 methods allocates 1.3% less (2.78 MB); the generated code is unchanged.",
